{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/hilton-residences-emirates-developments-jumeirah-lake-towers","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1321,"crm_id":"3027","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Hilton Residences","slug":"hilton-residences-emirates-developments-jumeirah-lake-towers","display_address":"Jumeirah Lake Towers (JLT)","building_type":["apartment","sky-villa"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Emirates Developments","price":1150000,"display_price":"1.15M","lattitude":25.0227332,"longitude":55.2957332,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Hilton Residences at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/jumeirah-lake-towers/\">Jumeirah Lake Towers</a> is a 38-floor architectural icon located in Cluster F, JLT. Developed by Emirates Developments, this landmark project features 396 residential units, including <strong>studio, 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments, and 4-bedroom sky villas.</strong> Just steps away from the DMCC Metro Station, it offers a vibrant lifestyle surrounded by lakefront views, business districts, and Dubai’s finest leisure destinations.</p><p>Each residence at Hilton Residences by Emirates Developments reflects Hilton’s signature design language that blends hospitality, innovation, and modern comfort. The project features a glass-bordered infinity pool, a kids’ pool, a premium gym, and a signature spa, creating a complete lifestyle destination. With a globally trusted brand name, a central address, and just a 5% down payment, Hilton Residences JLT promises exceptional investment value and strong ROI potential for both homeowners and investors.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/New_Project_2026_04_24_T164519_602_6a4788c78d.png","hash":"New_Project_2026_04_